":"https://www.electronjs.org/ja/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging-アプリケーションのデバッグ | Electron","title":"アプリケーションのデバッグ | Electron","items":[{"url":"https://www.electronjs.org/ja/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging","domain":"electronjs.org","title":"アプリケーションのデバッグ | Electron","snippet":"アプリケーションのデバッグ  Electron アプリケーションが望むように動作しないときは、デバッグツール一式がコーディングエラー、パフォーマンスのボトルネック、最適化の機会を見つけるのに役立つかもしれません。  レンダラープロセス​  個々のレンダラープロセスをデバッグするための最も包括的なツールは、Chromium Developer Toolset です。 `BrowserWindow`..."}]}]},{"key":"https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/tutorial/sandbox/","domain":"electronjs.org","url":"https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/tutorial/sandbox/","titles":[{"key":"https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/tutorial/sandbox/-Process Sandboxing | Electron","title":"Process Sandboxing | Electron","items":[{"url":"https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/tutorial/sandbox/","domain":"electronjs.org","title":"Process Sandboxing | Electron","snippet":"PROCESS SANDBOXING  One key security feature in Chromium is that processes can be executed within a sandbox. The sandbox limits the harm that malicious code can cause by limiting access to most syste..."}]}]},{"key":"https://www.electronjs.org/pt/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging","domain":"electronjs.org","url":"https://www.electronjs.org/pt/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging","titles":[{"key":"https://www.electronjs.org/pt/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging-Depuração de Aplicativos | Electron","title":"Depuração de Aplicativos | Electron","items":[{"url":"https://www.electronjs.org/pt/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging","domain":"electronjs.org","title":"Depuração de Aplicativos | Electron","snippet":"DEPURAÇÃO DE APLICATIVOS  Sempre que seu aplicativo Electron não estiver se comportando do jeito que você queria, você pode usar uma gama de ferramentas te dão uma força para descobrir erros no seu c..."}]}]},{"key":"https://www.electronjs.org/es/docs/latest/tutorial/application-debugging"